Chapter: RocOrPatternPayload
  cites Foreword chapter Console

 After roc-lang/roc, src/eval/test/eval_regression_repros.zig, B036
 "or-pattern alternatives bind the same names", which Roc REJECTS when the
 alternatives bind different names (`Ok(x) | Err(y) => x`). This is the
 accepted sibling: both alternatives bind the same name, and the arm reads
 it.

     match Err(2) { Ok(x) | Err(x) => x }                         2

Section: Types

  Res (a) (e) =
   | Ok (a)
   | Err (e)

Section: Functions

  either : Res Integer Integer -> Integer
  either (v) =
   when v
    is Ok (x) | Err (x) -> x

Section: Entry

  opening : [Console] Nothing
  opening = act
   print-line-uni (show (either (Err 2)))
   print-line-uni (show (either (Ok 5)))
  end
